a></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><a title="Learn more about Spinoza" translate="no" class="no-link-color" href="/software/spinoza/about/"><h2 translate="no" class="text-[1.6em] md:text-[1.875em] [&amp;&gt;a]:!text-[var(--linkColorHeader)] md:[overflow-wrap:normal] !text-2xl lg:!text-3xl">Spinoza</h2></a></div><div id="like-button-container" class="ml-auto flex flex-shrink-0 justify-end lg:ml-0 lg:justify-start"><div class="ModernLikeButton-module-scss-module__xuujAq__likeWrapper lg:min-w-[220px]"><span title="Like Spinoza" class="ModernLikeButton-module-scss-module__xuujAq__heart " role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Like Spinoza"><span class="flex h-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-brand-light5 bg-[var(--brandLight6)] text-[var(--headingButton)] w-auto p-2 [&amp;_span]:ml-0.5 [&amp;_span]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_span]:text-[0.9em] [&amp;_svg]:h-3.5 [&amp;_svg]:w-3.5"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M458.4 64.3C400.6 15.7 311.3 23 256 79.3 200.7 23 111.4 15.6 53.6 64.3-21.6 127.6-10.6 230.8 43 285.5l175.4 178.7c10 10.2 23.4 15.9 37.6 15.9 14.3 0 27.6-5.6 37.6-15.8L469 285.6c53.5-54.7 64.7-157.9-10.6-221.3zm-23.6 187.5L259.4 430.5c-2.4 2.4-4.4 2.4-6.8 0L77.2 251.8c-36.5-37.2-43.9-107.6 7.3-150.7 38.9-32.7 98.9-27.8 136.5 10.5l35 35.7 35-35.7c37.8-38.5 97.8-43.2 136.5-10.6 51.1 43.1 43.5 113.9 7.3 150.8z"></path></svg><span> <!-- -->4 likes</span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hidden sm:flex justify-end items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"></div></div><div class="col-span-2 line-clamp-3 lg:line-clamp-2"><div class="md_Compact"><p>Spinoza is a local, source-available Kubernetes IDE that brings cluster resources, Helm, live YAML editing, logs, port-forwarding, and Flux/Argo workflows into one place. It runs as a single binary, installs with one shell command, and requires no account or per-seat subscription.</p></div></div><div class="col-span-2 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><div class="BadgeRow-module-scss-module__o_ZNEq__badgeRow" style="max-height:30px"><div class="BadgeRow-module-scss-module__o_ZNEq__content"><ul class="flex gap-1 flex-wrap" data-testid="lp-row"><li class="list-none"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded ring-1 ring-inset ring-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_12%,transparent)] h-5 px-1.5 text-[11px] [&amp;&gt;svg]:mr-1 text-[var(--positiveGreenerDark)] bg-[var(--positiveGreenerLight)] [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--positiveGreener)] cursor-default">Free</span></li><li class="list-none"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded ring-1 ring-inset ring-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_12%,transparent)] h-5 px-1.5 text-[11px] [&amp;&gt;svg]:mr-1 text-[var(--positiveGreenerDark)] bg-[var(--positiveGreenerLight)] [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--positiveGreener)] cursor-default">Source Available<!-- --> <!-- -->(<a href="https://fsl.software/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">FSL-1.1-ALv2</a>)</span></li><li class="list-none"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded ring-1 ring-inset ring-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_12%,transparent)] h-5 px-1.5 text-[11px] bg-[var(--gray150)] text-[var(--mainFg)] [&amp;&gt;svg]:mr-1 [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--introBoxMeta)] cursor-default">Windows</span></li><li class="list-none"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded ring-1 ring-inset ring-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_12%,transparent)] h-5 px-1.5 text-[11px] bg-[var(--gray150)] text-[var(--mainFg)] [&amp;&gt;svg]:mr-1 [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[var(--introBoxMeta)] cursor-default">Mac</span></li><li class="list-none"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded ring-1 ring-inset ring-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_12%,transparent)] h-5 px-1.5 text-[11px] bg-[var(--gray150)] text-[var(--mainFg